# 674 MB: committed in a9366e2 (2026-09-15) and made the whole branch unpushable --
# GitHub rejects any file over 100 MB. Purged from history 2026-10-03.
experiments/covalentformer/data/instructions/pairs_v2.jsonl

# MODEL WEIGHTS ARE NEVER COMMITTED. The audit that followed the purge above found 400 files
# over 50 MB sitting untracked but unignored -- 210 *.prior, 181 *.chkpt, 3 *.tgz, mostly under
# data/ and models/ -- so a single `git add -A` would have recreated the same unpushable branch.
# Nothing of these extensions was tracked at the time these rules were added (verified), so they
# mask no history. Weights belong in GCS or on the training box, not in git.
*.chkpt
*.ckpt
*.prior
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.tgz
